        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "reach_cache_active"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 40,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Hand over the recovered deed",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:sidequest/reach_cache/turnin"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "report_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Ask her to re-mark the cache",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:sidequest/reach_cache/resurvey"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "remark_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Still searching",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The bearing is on the board and the sand does not move house. Follow my chalk line and watch for the dust-shimmer standing over the dig - the desert marks its own, if you know to look."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Brush, never shovel. A shovel scatters what the sand spent a lifetime keeping, and then neither of us gets paid."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ossa - the bearing stands",
                    Label: "active"
                },
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "reach_cache_first_done"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 25,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Take another cache bearing",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add reach_cache_active"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:sidequest/reach_cache/accept"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "accept_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Later",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "later_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "That first deed you brought in carried a second seal, a cut I have seen on one charter in my life. (she looks from the drawer to your face, then away) Bad light. The records pay the same either way - shall I mark you another?"
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The desert keeps what people bury, and it has kept a name under that Company mark I am not fool enough to say aloud. Some finds you file. Some you file face down. There are more caches out there either way."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "If you find yourself out by the Crossroads Granary - it was never theirs to hold. Someone should go take it back. My drawer full of your deeds is the reason; you can be the argument."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ossa - some finds you file face down",
                    Label: "epilogue"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Take a cache bearing",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "tag @s add reach_cache_active"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "function cobblemon_initiative:sidequest/reach_cache/accept"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "accept_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Later",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "later_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Ossa. I keep the old land records - what the dunes have not eaten. Half my ledger is caches the old Reach buried against bad seasons and never came back for."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The records name where. The sand still holds what. Bring me back a cache deed and the records pay a flat rate, every time - the Company would call that inefficient sentiment, which is how I know it is right."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I will chalk you the bearing and lend the brush. The desert does the rest - watch for the shimmer standing over the sand."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Warden Ossa",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
